     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">It is the problem of using starting values from the factanal function. You may use the following command to use the starting values provided from lavaan:<div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(0,0,0)\">efa</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(102,102,0)\">.</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(0,0,0)\">fiml </span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(102,102,0)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> efaUnrotate</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(0,0,0)\">dat</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(0,102,102)\">2</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(0,0,0)\">missing</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&#39;fiml&#39;, start = FALSE</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><br></div><div><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(102,102,0)\"><br></span></div><div>I will figure it out why the factanal function does not work. Thank you for letting us know.<span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(102,102,0)\"><br></span></div><div><br></div><div>Sunthud</div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
