e=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>names</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">as</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">t</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">outer</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;x&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;y&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">paste</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sep</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>miss </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> matrix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ncol</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">nrow</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">500</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sample</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">FALSE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5000</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">9</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\">replace</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>dat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">miss</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> NA</span></div></code></div><div><br></div></div><div>Now, running normal cfa() with FIML is no problem:</div><div><br></div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">mod1 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;<br>tau1 =~ x1 + x2 + x3 + x4 + x5<br>tau2 =~ y1 + y2 + y3 + y4 + y5&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>cfa</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">fiml </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> cfa</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mod1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">missing</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;fiml&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>cfa</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">fiml<br></span></div></code></div><div><br>and neither is running the efaUnrotate() with listwise deletion</div><div><br></div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">efa</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">listwise </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> efaUnrotate</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>efa</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">listwise<br></span></div></code></div><div><br>but when I try to run</div><div><br></div><div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">efa</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">fiml </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> efaUnrotate</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">missing</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;fiml&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><br></div></div><div>I get</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#606\">Error</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> optim</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">start</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">FAfn</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">FAgr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> method </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;L-BFGS-B&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> lower </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> lower</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>  L</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">BFGS</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">B needs finite values of </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;fn&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">In</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> addition</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Warning</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> message</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">In</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> log</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">e</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">NaNs</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> produced</span></div></code></div><div><br></div></div><div>Any ideas or suggestions what I can do to obtain an EFA with FIML estimation? Any help would be greatly appreciated!</div><div><br></div><div>Best, Martin</div></div></blockquote></div></div>"
    ],
