   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Thanks, Sunthud. This works like a charm. <div><br></div><div>The problem seems to be that the manifest covariance matrix that is taken from the SampleStats-Slot  in Line 36:</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">covtemp </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> outtemp@SampleStats@cov</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]]</span></div></code></div><br>is not positive definite in the FIML case. I&#39;ve looped this over some random samples and this never seems to be the case - not even if there aren&#39;t actually any missings. So perhaps it would be more stable to take the starting values from factanal() simply applied to the data provided instead of it having to first pass through cfa().</div><div><br></div><div>So, thanks again for the tip!</div><div><br></div><div>Best, Martin</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br><br>On Wednesday, October 1, 2014 7:00:13 PM UTC+2, Sunthud Pornprasertmanit wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">It is the problem of using starting values from the factanal function. You may use the following command to use the starting values provided from lavaan:<div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(0,0,0)\">efa</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(102,102,0)\">.</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(0,0,0)\">fiml </span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(102,102,0)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> efaUnrotate</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(0,0,0)\">dat</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(0,102,102)\">2</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(0,0,0)\">missing</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&#39;fiml&#39;, start = FALSE</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><br></div><div><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(102,102,0)\"><br></span></div><div>I will figure it out why the factanal function does not work. Thank you for letting us know.<span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(102,102,0)\"><br></span></div><div><br></div><div>Sunthud</div></div><div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Wed, Oct 1, 2014 at 11:09 AM, Martin Schultze <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">marts...@googlemail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hey guys,<div><br></div><div>I don&#39;t really know whether this belongs here - because it&#39;s specific to semTools - but I guess if there&#39;s an answer to be found, I will find it here. I&#39;m trying to run an EFA with the efaUnrotate function and want to use FIML for missing data handling. Here&#39;s some data-generating code:</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">semTools</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#008\">set</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">seed</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">593720</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>tau1 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> rnorm</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">500</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>tau2 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> rnorm</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">500</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>lam </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">8</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">7</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">8</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">7</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">8</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>x </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> tau1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">%*%</span><span style=\"color:#000\">t</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lam</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> rnorm</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2500</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>y </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> tau2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">%*%</span><span style=\"color:#000\">t</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lam</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> rnorm</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2500</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>dat </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">frame</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">y</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>names</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">as</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">t</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">outer</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;x&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;y&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">paste</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sep</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>miss </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> matrix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ncol</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">nrow</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">500</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sample</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">FALSE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5000</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">9</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\">replace</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>dat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">miss</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> NA</span></div></code></div><div><br></div></div><div>Now, running normal cfa() with FIML is no problem:</div><div><br></div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">mod1 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;<br>tau1 =~ x1 + x2 + x3 + x4 + x5<br>tau2 =~ y1 + y2 + y3 + y4 + y5&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>cfa</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">fiml </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> cfa</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mod1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">missing</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;fiml&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>cfa</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">fiml<br></span></div></code></div><div><br>and neither is running the efaUnrotate() with listwise deletion</div><div><br></div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">efa</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">listwise </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> efaUnrotate</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>efa</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">listwise<br></span></div></code></div><div><br>but when I try to run</div><div><br></div><div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">efa</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">fiml </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> efaUnrotate</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">missing</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;fiml&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><br></div></div><div>I get</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background